# Website Design Template: "Blueprint Dark" (reverse-engineered from ArtCraft)

Source: 5 screenshots (home, pricing, FilmCraft app page, DesignCraft app page, tutorials). All pixel values are estimates from screenshots at ~1351px viewport width. Fonts are identified by look; sub-pixel precision varies.

