## 1. Design concept (one paragraph)

Dark, technical, editorial. The page is drawn like an engineering blueprint: 1px hairline borders divide everything into numbered cells, mono micro-labels annotate every cell, crosshair marks sit at section corners, a vertical ruler with scroll-position numbers runs the right edge, and a section index floats left-to-right on scroll. No rounded corners, no shadows, no gradients (except a dark vignette on media). Accent colors are muted 12–18% into the dark background, used for plan highlights, active states, and category tags. Typography mixes sans for body copy and buttons with one italic serif accent word per headline, tinted in the section's accent color. Typography is extended and heavy (700–800 weight), tracking tight, rendering like a technical manual written by designers.

---

## 2. Design tokens

### 2.1 Color
```
--bg:            #0c0d12   page background (near-black, slight blue tint)
--bg-raised:     #101117   cells, cards, footer
--bg-media:      #050506   empty media/video frames
--line:          #23252d   all 1px borders/dividers
--line-strong:   #3a3d48   button outlines, active frames
--text:          #ffffff   headlines
--text-body:     #c9ccd6   paragraphs on dark
--text-muted:    #7b7f8c   mono labels, captions, meta
--text-dim:      #555966   index numbers, ruler ticks
--inverse-bg:    #ffffff   primary button, active nav item, active toggle
--inverse-text:  #0c0d12
--brand-blue:    #2f6bff   promo banner, ticker dots, "ends soon" badge, logo overlay
--accent-1:      #0fa36b   green  (plan 1)
--accent-2:      #9b4dff   purple (plan 2 / FilmCraft)
--accent-3:      #e07b00   orange (plan 3)
--accent-4:      #3b6fe0   blue   (enterprise)
--accent-lime:   #a6e22e   lime   (DesignCraft)
```
Rule: card backgrounds = accent color at ~12-18% over --bg (dark green, dark purple, dark brown, dark navy). Light-theme toggle exists (sun icon, top right); invert --bg/--text and keep --line at ~12% opacity on white bg.

### 2.2 Typography
- Display / headlines: extended heavy grotesque, weight 700-800, tight tracking (-0.02em), line-height 1.0-1.05. Substitutes: Syne ExtraBold, Unbounded, Clash Display, Space Grotesk 700. Logo wordmark uses custom extended sans.
- Accent word: italic serif, regular weight, same size as surrounding headline, set lighter in feel. Substitute: Instrument Serif Italic, Playfair Display Italic. Used on exactly ONE word per headline (e.g., "Create without *limits.*").
- Variant on app pages: accent word is NOT italic serif; it is the same sans in the app accent color ("rebuilt", "publishing").
- Mono labels: monospace, uppercase, 10-11px, letter-spacing 0.12-0.16em, color --text-muted. Substitutes: JetBrains Mono, IBM Plex Mono, Space Mono.
- Body: clean neo-grotesque sans (Inter / Hanken Grotesk), 15-16px, line-height 1.6, color --text-body.
- Sizes (desktop): H1 hero 72-96px; H2 section 56-64px; card title 20-22px; plan price 56px; body 15-16px; button label 11-12px mono uppercase bold; mono caption 10-11px.

### 2.3 Spacing and shape
- Base unit 8px. Section vertical padding 96-128px. Cell internal padding 24-32px.
- Border radius: 0 everywhere (buttons, cards, inputs, badges). Exceptions: app icons (rounded square ~20% radius), pill badges ("20% OFF", "MOST POPULAR") are rectangular, not pill-rounded.
- Borders: 1px solid --line. Highlighted card: 2px solid accent.
- No shadows. No gradients except a faint dark-to-transparent overlay on media bottoms for text legibility and subtle colored tint on cards.

