## 3. Global layout system

### 3.1 Frame
- Viewport split: fixed 44px left gutter (empty, with the frame line at x=44), content column between x=44 and x=viewport-28, right rail 28px.
- Vertical hairlines run full page height at left and right edges of the content column. Content never touches the viewport edge.
- Content column is fluid up to ~1280px wide; all sections are full width of the column.
- Every section is a horizontal band separated by 1px horizontal lines running full column width.
- Crosshair "+" marks (8-10px, 1px lines, --text-dim) at the intersection of section dividers and frame lines, both sides.

### 3.2 Top navigation (fixed, 48px tall, --bg, bottom border)
- Row of equal-height cells separated by 1px vertical lines.
- Cell 1: square logo cell (white logo mark, 48x48).
- Left group (mono uppercase 11px, tracking 0.14em): HOME, IMAGE, VIDEO, RESOURCES with caret, DOWNLOAD, SUPPORT. Then a divider and CRAFT APPS as its own cell.
- Right group: PRICING, Discord icon cell, theme (sun) icon cell, then LAUNCH APP as a solid white cell with dark text, flush to the right edge.
- Active/open state: item gets white background + dark text (HOME on home, RESOURCES when dropdown open).
- Hover: text white, subtle --bg-raised fill.
- Nav is sticky; it re-appears mid-page overlaying content.
- Dropdown (RESOURCES): Tutorials, Articles(News), FAQ, Press Kit, Support.

### 3.3 Promo banner (optional, pricing page)
- Full-width strip directly under nav, 44px tall, solid --brand-blue. Left: tag icon + mono "LIMITED-TIME OFFER". Right-of-center: sentence in normal sans, white, 14px.

### 3.4 Right rail (fixed, 28px wide, full height)
- Vertical ruler: tick marks every 5 units with numbers (0, 5, 10, 15 ... 45) in --text-dim mono 10px, positioned beside a 1px line. Number tracks scroll position as a progress ruler.
- Section index (scroll-spy): right-aligned list of uppercase bold sans labels (about 14px) floating over the page near the right edge, e.g. ARTCRAFT / FEATURES / OWNERSHIP / COMMUNITY / GET STARTED. Dots in --brand-blue precede each label.

### 3.5 Section caption strip (repeats on every section)
- 48px-tall row at the section's top or bottom edge, split in two: left "NN / SECTION NAME" (e.g. "01 / PRICING", "02 / CHOOSE YOUR PLAN"), right a short descriptor ("FREE & OPEN SOURCE · SUBSCRIPTIONS OPTIONAL†").
- Numbering is sequential per page and restarts on each page.

