## 4. Components

### 4.1 Buttons (all radius 0, height 44-48px, padding 0 24px, mono 11-12px uppercase bold, tracking 0.12em)
- Primary: white bg, dark text, optional leading icon(s) (apple/monitor/download), no border.
- Secondary: transparent bg, 1px --line-strong border, white text; hover fills --bg-raised.
- Colored plan button: full width of card, solid accent bg, white text, trailing arrow "→".
- Split button (CONTACT US): left 85% solid accent with mail icon + label, right 15% darker segment with copy icon.
- GitHub button: outlined, GitHub icon + "VIEW SOURCE" / "VIEW ON GITHUB".
- Buttons are placed in a row with 12px gap, centered in heroes.

### 4.2 Segmented toggle (YEARLY | MONTHLY, ALL | 2D | 3D)
- Inline box, 1px border, equal-padding segments, mono 11px uppercase. Active segment = white bg, dark text. Neighbor text = --text-muted.
- Pricing toggle also shows to the right: blue badge "20% OFF · ENDS SOON" (--brand-blue bg, white mono) and plain blue mono "2 MONTHS FREE".

### 4.3 Badges and tags
- Discount pill: small rectangle, accent bg, white mono 10px bold ("20% OFF").
- Card header strip: 36px tall, accent bg, left label (icon + "MOST POPULAR" / "BEST VALUE" / "PLAN" / "FOR TEAMS"), right index "01"-"03".
- Category tag on cards: 1px outlined small box, mono 10px ("2D", "3D").
- Index number: mono, --text-dim, top-right of cell ("01").

### 4.4 Media cell (feature cell)
```
[ top bar 36px: LABEL (left, mono muted) .......... NN (right) ]
[ media area 16:9, bg --bg-media, image/video object-fit cover   ]
[ padding 24px: title (sans 700, 20px, white)                    ]
[                description (sans 14px, --text-body, max 3 lines)]
```
- Videos autoplay muted loop; show black until loaded.
- 1px border on all sides shared with neighbors (use border-collapse effect: cells share borders, no double lines).
- Last cell may be a CTA cell: dashed-border centered square icon button (arrow-up-right), mono URL under it, "+" corner marks.

### 4.5 Pricing card
Structure top to bottom:
1. Colored header strip (see 4.3).
2. Padding 32px: name (sans 700, 28px) + discount pill right-aligned; subtitle (muted 14px).
3. Price row: old price strikethrough in accent color (small, "$10"), new price 56px bold white "$8", "/mo" muted. Below, mono 11px: "$96 BILLED YEARLY · SAVE $24" with "SAVE $24" in accent.
4. Full-width colored CTA button.
5. Mono label "WHAT YOU GET", then checklist: square checkbox icon (accent border, accent checkmark), 14px text, 12px row gap.
6. Highlighted cards (Pro, Max) get 2px accent border; Basic and Enterprise use 1px.
- 4 equal columns, no gaps (borders shared). Enterprise: no price, large "Custom" 56px, mono "BESPOKE VOLUME & TERMS", split contact button, label "EVERYTHING IN MAX, PLUS" and a checklist in --accent-4.
- Trust strip under cards: single row of 4 items, each with small check icon + mono 11px uppercase text, evenly spaced.

### 4.3b Download platform column (app pages)
- 3 equal columns: macOS / Windows / Linux. Header row: mono "PLATFORM" + "01"; detected OS column shows "YOUR SYSTEM" instead and has a white primary button; others have outlined button.
- Under the button: mono label "OTHER WINDOWS DOWNLOADS" then a list of rows: title (sans 14px white), subtitle (muted 12px), filename (mono 11px --text-dim), download icon right. Rows separated by 1px --line.

### 4.4b Code/terminal block
- Mono label "TERMINAL" top-left, "COPY" button top-right (outlined, copy icon). Body: mono 13px, --bg-media bg, 1px border, 20px padding. Below it: outlined "VIEW SOURCE ON GITHUB" button.

### 4.5b App card (family section)
- 3x2 grid, 1px shared borders. Top bar: number badge (accent square with number) + mono category ("IMAGE EDITOR", "VECTOR ILLUSTRATION", "PHOTO LIBRARY & RAW DEVELOPER", "PDF WORKBENCH", "MOTION GRAPHICS"), bottom section with app name (sans 18px white) + one-line description (14px --text-body). Click opens product page.

### 4.6 Marquee ticker
- Full-width strip, 48px tall, 1px line above and below. Items: mono 11px uppercase white-ish, each preceded by a small --brand-blue dot, separated by ~64px. Scrolls left continuously (30-40s loop, pauses on hover). Duplicated content creates seamless loop.

### 4.7 Footer
- 5 columns, shared 1px dividers: [brand col 2x wide] logo, tagline (sans 16px, 2 lines), email in mono muted | PRODUCT | CRAFT APPS | RESOURCES | COMMUNITY. Column titles mono 11px muted uppercase; list items sans 14px white. Links turn --brand-blue on hover.
- Bottom bar (48px): left "© 2026 BRAND" mono; right "MADE BY [X], FOR [Y]" mono.

### 4.8 Hero logo/app header (app pages)
- Centered 72px rounded-square app icon, below it a tag chip: small accent square with number ("07") + app name in sans.

