## 5. Page recipes (section order and exact content structure)

### 5.1 Home
1. Hero (centered, ~560px): large logo wordmark (custom wide type, white) -> H1 tagline 44px "Capable tools *for artists.*" -> 2-line paragraph (max-width 480px, --text-muted) -> button row [Primary "DOWNLOAD FOR DESKTOP"] [Secondary "LAUNCH IN BROWSER"].
2. Marquee ticker (4.6).
3. Features: left-aligned H2 64px "The control that mere *words* cannot buy." (max-width ~820px) + one-line subtitle. Below it a 2-column x 4-row grid of 8 media cells (4.4), numbered 01-08, each with top mono label ("IMAGE TO LOCATION", etc.), 16:9 image, title, and 2-line desc.
4. Ownership: H2 "Stop *renting* from websites." + 2-line paragraph. 3-column row (A, B, C): mono letter, title 22px, 14px description; column A has the GitHub button. Caption "02 / OWNERSHIP" | "FREE & OPEN SOURCE · TRANSPARENT DEVELOPMENT".
5. Community: H2 "Made *with* ArtCraft." Then 3 equal full-bleed image cards (aspect ~4:3), each with top mono label "COMMUNITY FILM" + index. Caption "03 / PROOF" | "FROM THE COMMUNITY".
6. CTA: centered mono eyebrow "FREE TO START · NO SUBSCRIPTION", H2 80px "Start *crafting.*", one-line paragraph, button row [white "DOWNLOAD FOR DESKTOP"] [outlined "LAUNCH IN BROWSER"].
7. Footer.

### 5.2 Pricing
1. Promo banner. 2. Caption "01 / PRICING" | "FREE & OPEN SOURCE · SUBSCRIPTIONS OPTIONAL†". 3. Hero left-aligned: H1 "Create without *limits.*" + 2-line paragraph, ~280px tall. 4. Caption "02 / CHOOSE YOUR PLAN" | "EVERY PAID PLAN INCLUDES VIDEO CREDITS". 5. Segmented toggle (YEARLY | MONTHLY) with badge and "2 MONTHS FREE" note. 6. 4-column pricing card grid (4.5), color-coded. 7. Trust strip. 8. Optional: credit packs, footnotes sections. 9. Footer.
- Yearly/monthly toggle swaps prices, strikethrough values, "BILLED YEARLY" line, and "SAVE $N" line.

### 5.3 Resources / Tutorials (list page template)
1. Caption "01 / TUTORIALS" | "VIDEO WALKTHROUGHS". 2. Hero left-aligned: H1 "Learn the *craft.*" + one-line paragraph. 3. Caption "02 / LIBRARY" | "FILTER BY EDITOR". 4. Segmented filter (ALL/2D/3D) with result count. 5. 3-column card grid of tutorial cards; each card is a 16:9 image with overlay label, title, 1-line desc. Click opens video or tutorial page. Caption "03 / LATEST" | "SORT BY NEWEST". 6. Footer.

### 5.4 App product page (FilmCraft / DesignCraft; one template, swap accent + content)
1. Hero (centered): app icon + number chip -> H1 56-64px "[What it is], *[accent word]* [rest]." (accent word colored in app accent, no serif) -> 2-line paragraph -> buttons [white "DOWNLOAD FOR WINDOWS"] [secondary "LEARN MORE"].
2. Hero screenshot: full-width image in a 1px frame, top-left mono caption "[SCREEN NAME] — [PROJECT]", bottom caption strip "01 / [APPNAME]" | "[CATEGORY] · IN DEVELOPMENT".
3. Highlights: H2 "What's *inside.*" (no accent in some versions) + 3x2 grid of text cells numbered 01-06 (index top-right, title 22px bold, 2-3 line description). Caption "02 / HIGHLIGHTS" | "[CATEGORY]".
4. Screenshots: mixed-size image grid (one wide image plus smaller ones, or a 4-up strip), each with a mono caption below ("EFFECT CONTROLS — [PROJECT]"). Caption "03 / SCREENSHOTS" | "CAPTURED IN BETA".
5. Get section: 3 platform columns (4.3b). Then 2 columns: left "Version 0.4.0." H2 with paragraph and "OTHER DOWNLOADS" list (FreeBSD, Web build, SHA-256 checksums); right "Run it today." H2, paragraph, inline terminal block (4.4b).
6. Family: H2 "More from the *family.*" with "ALL CRAFTING APPS ↗" right-aligned mono. 3x2 app cards (4.5b), current app excluded or shown. Caption "05 / THE FAMILY" | "CRAFTING APPS".
7. CTA: eyebrow "OPEN SOURCE · FREE", H2 "Help shape [App]." with app name in accent color, sentence, outlined "JOIN THE DISCORD" button.
8. Footer. Right-rail index labels: [APPNAME] / HIGHLIGHTS / SCREENSHOTS / GET IT / THE FAMILY / GET STARTED.

