## 8. Content and copy rules

- Headline pattern: 3-6 words, one word swapped to italic serif accent, ends with a period. Examples: "Create without *limits.*", "Learn the *craft.*", "Start *crafting.*".
- Sub-copy: 1-2 sentences, plain, anti-subscription/anti-middleman tone, second person ("yours to own").
- All micro-labels are uppercase mono with middle-dot separators (" · ") and "NN / NAME" numbering.
- Product family naming: [Prefix]Craft with one mascot per app and one accent color per app.
- Every section ends in either a CTA or a caption strip; every page ends in CTA then footer.

