## 9. Build prompt (paste into any AI coding tool)

```
Build a [SITE TYPE] website for [BRAND] using the "Blueprint Dark" design system below.

Brand: [NAME], tagline: "[Tagline with one *italic serif* word]"
Primary accent: [HEX]; secondary accents: [HEX list]
Display font: [e.g. Syne 800]; accent serif: [e.g. Instrument Serif Italic]; mono: [e.g. JetBrains Mono]; body: [e.g. Inter]
Pages: [Home, Pricing, Resources, Product pages...]
Sections for Home in order: [hero, ticker with items X, features grid with N cells (label/title/desc/media), ownership/value 3 columns, proof gallery, CTA]

Follow the spec exactly: 44px left gutter with 1px frame lines, 28px right rail with ruler ticks and scroll-spy section index, fixed 48px top nav of bordered mono cells with a solid white launch button, full-width sections separated by 1px lines with crosshairs at corners.
Behaviors: marquee ticker, scroll-spy rail, yearly/monthly toggle, OS-detected download button, copy-to-clipboard, filter segmented control, theme toggle.
Responsive: stack to one column under 768px, hide rail.
Stack: [HTML/CSS/JS | React + Tailwind | Next.js].
```

