## 10. Checklist before shipping a new site with this template

1. Every section has a numbered caption strip and 1px dividers.
2. Exactly one accent word per headline.
3. All labels, buttons, badges are mono uppercase; body is sans.
4. No border radius, no shadows, no gradients (except media overlays).
5. Cells share borders (no double lines, no gaps).
6. Each product/plan has exactly one accent color used for its header, button, checkmarks, and highlights.
7. Right rail, ruler, and crosshair marks present on desktop.
8. Footer matches 5-column structure with bottom mono bar.
9. Media frames show --bg-media black while loading.
10. Tested at 1440, 1024, 768, 390 widths.
